invariant: INV-35
file: Makefile
catches: test/lib-check-webpki-tcp-nonblocking.sh
reason: The object's header includes each public header by its path in
  the tree, include/chapulin/tls.h and the rest, in place of the
  chapulin/tls.h a consumer names. A consumer compiles with -Iinclude and
  the header, as README.md says, and then finds no
  include/include/chapulin/tls.h, so lib-check's consumer under the
  header alone fails to compile.

--- old
	  for h in $(notdir $(LIB_HEADERS)); do printf '#include "chapulin/%s"\n' "$$h"; done; \
--- new
	  for h in $(LIB_HEADERS); do printf '#include "%s"\n' "$$h"; done; \
